WEBVTT

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:08.830
Maria Watches Over Us

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:16.140
Spreading a blank map wide open
Shiroi chizu ookiku hiroge

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:23.120
Let's go hide the treasure box
Takara-bako kakushi ni ikou

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:31.190
No need for coats or even hats
Kooto nante iranai boushi mo ne

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:38.830
Armed with just mechanical pencil lead
Shaapen no shin dake haite

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.240
Round and round and round,
Kururu kururu ku

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.140
Running through
kakenukeru

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.110
Round and round and round,
Kururu kururu ku

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:54.070
Our footprints mark the X
ashiato wa batsu-jirushi da yo

00:00:54.520 --> 00:01:01.090
Passing through the walls of the school
Kousha no kabe tsuki-nuke

00:01:01.090 --> 00:01:09.330
We can go anywhere, there will be a path there
Dokonimo ikeru soko ni michi ga aru

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:16.530
The pleats of our skirts won't be disturbed
Sukaato no hida midare-nai

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:23.870
If it's a secret journey
Himitsu no tabi nara

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:35.650
Yumi.

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:36.820
Yes?

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:40.160
Find a little sister.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.230
My dear sister is a liar.

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:49.040
On this day, one year
since we became soeurs,

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.270
the assignment she gave me...

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:54.900
...was something I hadn't
even dreamed of until today.

00:01:56.410 --> 00:02:01.280
The Soeur Audition

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:15.000
Being told something like that so suddenly...

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:21.470
Besides, for me to be in the role
of a big sister to someone...

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:22.800
I'm still not...

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:24.970
Since it's come to this,

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:27.440
I think there's no choice but to
hold an audition or something.

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:29.470
Au?

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.480
An audition. For a petite soeur.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:35.040
Oh, for a petite soeur.

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:37.590
Wait, for a little sister?!

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:38.420
Yup.

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:41.680
Right now, the Rose Mansion
is short on first-year students.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:46.060
Around this time last year,
it was Shimako-san, you, and me.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.720
There were three of us,
like there's supposed to be, but now...

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.200
It's the same as a farming village
with a shortage of brides.

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.700
Noriko-chan, are you fine with how things are?

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:57.190
It's a bit of a problem.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:01.200
Thinking back, there were
no chance meetings for me.

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:04.240
In that sense, you're lucky, Yumi-san.

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.210
You have Toko-chan and Kanako-chan.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.370
I wish you'd share one with me.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:11.350
Share one with you?

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:14.160
Are Toko-chan and
Kanako-chan the same as ever?

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.590
Yes.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:20.820
Anyway, I'm going to choose my
little sister through an audition.

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:22.320
That is a good idea.

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:27.570
Onee-sama...

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:29.360
So?

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:32.570
Please do not get the wrong idea.

00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:34.680
It is Yoshino-san who is holding the audition.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:38.340
Oh, but you are the same in that
you have no little sister, Yumi.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:40.420
T-That is true, but...

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:41.880
Since the opportunity has presented itself,

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:44.550
get yourself involved in this plan as well.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:47.410
P-Please wait one moment!

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:49.350
Onee-sama, what about my opinion on this?!

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:50.850
Opinion?

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:53.800
"There is no need for an audition."

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:56.730
"There is already a first-year student
I want for my little sister."

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:57.990
Is that what you mean?

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:00.490
Then bring her here right away.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:01.500
No...

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.200
If you cannot bring her,

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:06.260
then seek out your little
sister through the audition.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.640
T-This is so unreasonable!

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:11.470
You are being mean, Onee-sama!

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:15.180
Unreasonable?

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:17.420
I am hurt you would think so.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:23.250
I hardened my heart to say this for
the sake of my dear little sister.

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:26.260
It doesn't look that way to me...

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.730
If you don't like it, leave this
room and go look for her.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:31.670
You never know,

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:34.860
your soeur candidate might be standing
on the other side of this door.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:38.830
So you expect me to become
a Straw Millionaire as well?

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:41.840
What are you talking about?

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:43.870
She has no idea that she grabbed "the straw."

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.640
I understand!

00:04:45.710 --> 00:04:47.010
I will go look for her!

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:49.050
I just have to find her, right?!

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:55.850
One year ago, Sachiko-sama also
left the room in anger like this.

00:04:57.160 --> 00:05:00.030
The person she ran into then was me.

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:07.470
What is this sense of déjà vu?

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:11.700
Does this mean the person I'm about
to run into is my fated little sister?!

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:21.310
Yumi-chan, give me a break.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:23.580
Rosa Foetida!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:24.950
I am sorry!

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:27.560
Is she lucky or not?
It's all right. Are you hurt at all?

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.050
It's so hard to tell with her.
It's all right. Are you hurt at all?

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:34.020
In the end, I took a u-turn.

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:36.590
That's news to me!

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:38.160
I imagine so.

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:40.400
I mentioned it for the first time just earlier.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.840
When do you plan to hold it?

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:46.430
I am thinking of next Saturday.

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:49.280
Why so soon?

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:53.040
Besides, there's no way you'll
find her through an audition!

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.420
Of course, I'll find her!

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:56.580
I'll pick one, even if it kills me!

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:58.450
Even if it kills you?

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:01.890
Why are you in such a hurry?

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:03.620
I'm not really...

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.700
All right, I'll accept the audition.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:10.700
But let's do it after the Kendo Club's
interschool competition is over...

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:12.000
...two weeks from now.

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:13.930
It'll be too late then!

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:19.140
So you do have some kind of reason.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:24.070
When I saw Eriko-sama at the sports fest,

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:25.970
I ended up making a promise to her.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:32.120
A bouton can only be considered
full-fledged when she finds a soeur,

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:35.780
so why is it that you still
can't find a little sister?

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:40.830
I wonder if it's because
Rei spoils you too much.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:44.390
If I put my mind to it, finding
a little sister would be nothing...

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:46.700
You don't have to put up
appearances, you know.

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:48.270
I am not!

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:50.270
There is a first-year student
that I have in mind,

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.400
so I will introduce her to you eventually.

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:55.410
When will that be?

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:58.610
L-Later...

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.150
We're going to be busy...

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.490
...with the school trip and the
school festival after this, so...

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:07.390
Then, once you're done with that,

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:09.950
how about the day of the Kendo
Club's interschool competition?

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:10.920
What?

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:13.050
Fine!

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:18.400
Eriko-sama seemed a bit down somehow, so...

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:23.930
I said I'd introduce her to my little
sister to try to cheer her up.

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:31.050
I had no idea that you were so concerned
for Eriko Onee-sama...

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:31.940
What?

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:34.610
Then we'd better hurry.

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:36.580
Next Saturday.

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:39.950
Let's get permission from the school
as a Yamayuri Council project.

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.580
Yes.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:46.660
Year 2, Pine Class

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:48.000
Year 2, Pine Class
I heard!

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.790
So you're holding a soeur audition?

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:53.670
Who did you hear it from?

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:56.500
The Rosa Chinensis came by the school paper.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:59.670
You're not keen on it?

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:00.870
No.

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:02.100
Why is that?

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:06.610
The thing is, I don't really know why myself...

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:12.020
I'm fine with that.

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:15.110
It's not like I'm attached to the
idea of doing it as an audition.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:16.560
What?

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:19.890
If you're bothered by the
idea of screening people,

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.700
I'd be fine with going with a
format that makes you happy.

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:26.570
Either way, I don't care as long
as I find a little sister.

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:31.600
A format that I'd be happy with...

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:38.110
All right, I'll buckle down too.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:40.210
Let's do the audition.

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:41.880
But in exchange,

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:45.550
since I'm doing this, I'll propose a
format that will make me happy.

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:47.250
Ooh.
Ooh.

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:56.400
Rather than an audition,
I would like to make it a tea party.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:59.900
The purpose will also not be limited
to our search for little sisters,

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:02.170
and we will broadly assemble
students seeking soeurs...

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:03.470
...and provide them an occasion to meet.

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:05.840
In other words, a group match-making event?

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:07.140
How old fashioned.

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:09.880
If you are going to say that,
should it not be a "mixer"?

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:12.970
We will have the Lillian Ledger
put out a call for participants.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:15.150
In terms of conditions...

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:19.380
For first-years, students who have
never sworn to be soeurs.

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:23.390
And for second-years, students who
have never had a little sister.

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:29.130
So, the participants will have tea,
chat, and then what?

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:30.290
That is all.

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:32.560
Since this is ultimately just
a chance to meet people.

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:36.800
Will you be able to decide on your
petite soeur in this way?

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:39.140
If the decision can be made on the spot,

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.130
naturally, I intend to make the offer.

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:45.850
If I am not certain, I am thinking
of talking to a couple of them...

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:48.510
...and having them come
help out at the Rose Mansion.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:50.820
I see.

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:53.780
In that case, you handle things on your own.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:55.120
What?

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:57.220
I'll withdraw myself as well.

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:58.590
The competition's soon anyway.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.290
Please wait, Onee-sama!

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:03.120
Might we not ask you to attend?

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:05.200
How silly of you.

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:07.840
Rather than prepare seats for us,

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:09.770
increase the number of seats
you have for the participants.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:11.970
All right.

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:17.580
We will assist behind the scenes.

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:19.550
That will be a great help.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.580
And Mami-san, we will leave
the rest in your hands.

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:23.350
Yes.

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:28.250
What's with Rei-chan?!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:29.950
Yumi-san.

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:32.420
Let's make the application form
for the participants!

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:34.360
O-Okay.

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:37.820
Um, are you really sure about this?

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.660
Huh? About what?

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:41.960
Oh, it's nothing.

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:53.640
Did you see the Lillian Ledger?!

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:54.840
Of course!
Of course!

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:55.740
Ta-da!

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:56.320
Tea Party Set To Be Held!!
Turn in applications at the special postbox
on the first floor of the Rose Mansion

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:58.250
