on the first floor of the Rose Mansion
The tea party's set to be held!

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:01.320
And it says, "Furthermore,
the Rosa Foetida en bouton..."

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:04.590
"...and the Rosa Chinensis en bouton
are expected to participate as well"!

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.330
Hey, hey, Noriko-san.

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:11.660
About the tea party...

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:14.100
Toko-san will be participating too, right?

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:16.670
I do not know.

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:18.770
Why not ask her yourself?

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:21.840
But with Toko-san, even if she doesn't apply...

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:23.000
Right?
Right?

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.350
Ever since middle school,

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:28.510
she's been saying she wants to
eventually become a Lady Rose.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:31.680
I wonder what she'll do.

