No...

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:24.060
Well, we still have several
days until the deadline.

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:27.340
Let us wait for more people to
apply in the coming days.

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:28.270
Yes.

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:30.480
Oh, I will clean things up!

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:32.150
It's okay, it's okay.

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:33.840
T-Thank you very much.

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:35.580
Come to think of it,

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:39.040
it seems like neither Toko-san
nor Kanako-san has applied yet.

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:43.450
They haven't shown up at all
since the school festival...

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:48.460
Toko!

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:50.020
I'll help.

00:12:58.140 --> 00:12:59.040
Toko.

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:03.710
What do you think of Yumi-sama?

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:07.550
Easily flustered, very expressive with her face,

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:09.540
good-natured, scatterbrained...

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:12.580
...and popular among the first-years.

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:14.980
Or so I hear.

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:20.450
Do you want to become Yumi-sama's little sister?

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:25.190
What's the point of asking me that?!

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:31.730
Right, and then...

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:32.600
Oh...

00:13:36.010 --> 00:13:38.480
I wonder if Toko-san will be
participating in the tea party.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:41.000
It's a given! I'm sure she's invited.

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:42.910
Then it's just camouflage?

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:45.040
Of course! That's bound to be it.

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.890
I want to help you, Toko.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:55.160
There is nothing I need your help for.

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:01.220
Toko...

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:05.700
We got quite a few.

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:09.280
Now, let's see which bouton they chose.

